# Session 6 — Environment Variables
# ==================================
# 1. Copy this file to a new file called ".env" (in the same folder):
#        cp .env.example .env
# 2. Paste your FREE Mistral API key below (no quotes, no spaces).
#    Get one by registering at https://console.mistral.ai/
#    (Mistral offers a generous free tier for developers.)
# 3. Save. The scripts read this automatically via python-dotenv.
#
# NOTE: .env is git-ignored, so your key never gets committed. Never share it.

MISTRAL_API_KEY=paste-your-key-here
